      <h1>Canadian Tax Guide for <span class="msv__shimmer">Retiring in Spain</span></h1>
      <p>Moving to Spain as a Canadian retiree is exciting, but the tax implications are complex. CPP and OAS work differently abroad. Your RRSP and TFSA have unexpected consequences. The Canada-Spain tax treaty helps, but only if you understand it. Here's what you need to know before you go.</p>
